# Feature slice

When adding a domain, create all of these. Do not skip OpenAPI or container wiring.

1. `src/types/{domain}.types.ts`
2. `src/validators/{domain}.validator.ts` — Zod; auth routes include bearer headers; bodies `.strict()`
3. `src/repositories/{domain}.repository.ts`
4. `src/services/{domain}.service.ts`
5. `src/controllers/{domain}.controller.ts` — bind handlers; `response` helper
6. `src/routes/{domain}.routes.ts` — export default Router
7. `src/container.ts` — wire
8. `src/app.ts` — `app.use('/{path}', routes)`
9. `src/openapi/subscription-service.openapi.ts`
10. Prisma model only if the table/columns change

First slice: `subscription` (plans). Copy `Sahayi_User_Service` `master.*` for list and `family-member.*` for CRUD. Do not invent `models/` or `src/config/`.
